hadiths[23]{hadithnumber,text}:
"421","Shihab bin Abbad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Ibrahim bin Humaid ar-Ruwasi ne bayan kiya, Ismail se, Qais se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Abdullah ne farmaya: Jab aadmi apne sathi se kahe ke tu mera dushman hai to un donon mein se ek Islam se nikal gaya ya apne sathi se bari ho gaya."
"422","Musaddad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Abdul Wahid ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Laith ne bayan kiya, Taus se, Hazrat Ibn Abbas se, mera khayal hai ke unhon ne ise marfu bayan kiya, Laith ne shak kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Ibn Adam mein teen sau saath jor ya haddi ya mafsil hain, har ek par har din mein sadqa hai, har achhi baat sadqa hai, aadmi ka apne bhai ki madad karna sadqa hai, pani ka ghoont jo woh pilaye sadqa hai aur takleef deh cheez ko raste se hatana sadqa hai."
"423","Ibrahim bin Musa ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Ismail bin Jafar ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Ala bin Abdur Rahman ne bayan kiya, apne walid se, Hazrat Abu Huraira se, Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se, Aap ne farmaya: Gaali dene wale donon ne jo kaha so pehel karne wale par hai jab tak mazloom ziyadti na kare."
"424","Ahmad bin Isa ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Ibn Wahb ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Amr bin al-Haris ne khabar di, Yazid bin Abi Habib se, Sinan bin Saad se, Hazrat Anas se, Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se, Aap ne farmaya: Gaali dene wale donon ne jo kaha so pehel karne wale par hai yahan tak ke mazloom ziyadti kare."
"425","Aur Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Kya tum jante ho azh kya hai, unhon ne arz kiya: Allah aur Us ka Rasool zyada jante hain, Aap ne farmaya: Logon ki baat ek dusre tak pahunchana taake un ke darmiyan fasad dalen."
"426","Aur Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Beshak Allah Azza wa Jalla ne meri taraf wahi ki hai ke tawazo ikhtiyar karo aur tum mein se koi kisi par zulm na kare."
"427","Amr bin Marzuq ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamein Imran ne khabar di, Qatada se, Yazid bin Abdullah bin ash-Shikhkhir se, Hazrat Iyaz bin Himar se, unhon ne kaha: Maine arz kiya: Ya Rasoolallah, koi shakhs mujhe gaali deta hai, Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Gaali dene wale donon do shaitan hain jo ek dusre ko bura kehte hain aur ek dusre se jhoot bolte hain."
"428","Ahmad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se mere walid ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mujh se Ibrahim ne bayan kiya, Hajjaj bin Hajjaj se, Qatada se, Yazid bin Abdullah se, Hazrat Iyaz bin Himar se, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Beshak Allah ne meri taraf wahi ki hai ke tawazo ikhtiyar karo yahan tak ke koi shakhs kisi par zulm na kare aur koi shakhs kisi par fakhr na kare, phir maine arz kiya: Ya Rasoolallah, bataiye agar koi shakhs mujhe aisi majlis mein gaali de jo mujh se kamtar hon aur main use jawab dun to kya is mein mujh par koi gunah hai, Aap ne farmaya: Gaali dene wale donon do shaitan hain jo ek dusre ko bura kehte hain aur ek dusre se jhoot bolte hain. Iyaz ne kaha: Aur main Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam se jang ki halat mein tha to maine Aap ko Islam lane se pehle ek oontni tohfe mein di to Aap ne use qubool na kiya aur farmaya: Main mushrikon ke tohfe ko napasand karta hun."
"429","Ibrahim bin Musa ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Yahya bin Zakariya bin Abi Zaida ne khabar di, Zakariya se, Abu Ishaq se, Muhammad bin Saad bin Malik se, apne walid se, Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se, Aap ne farmaya: Musalman ko gaali dena fisq hai."
"430","Muhammad bin Sinan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamein Fulaih bin Sulaiman ne khabar di, unhon ne kaha: hum se Hilal bin Ali ne bayan kiya, Hazrat Anas se, unhon ne farmaya: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam na behuda go the na lanat karne wale the na gaali dene wale the, Aap narazgi ke mauqe par farmate the: Use kya hua, us ki peshani khaak alood ho."
"431","Sulaiman bin Harb ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Shuba ne bayan kiya, Zubaid se, unhon ne kaha: Maine Abu Wail se suna, Hazrat Abdullah se, Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se: Musalman ko gaali dena fisq hai aur us se ladna kufr hai."
"432","Abu Mamar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Abdul Waris ne bayan kiya, Husain se, Abdullah bin Buraida se, unhon ne kaha: hum se Yahya bin Yamar ne bayan kiya ke Abul Aswad ad-Dili ne un se bayan kiya ke unhon ne Hazrat Abu Zarr ko suna, unhon ne kaha: Maine Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko farmate hue suna: Koi shakhs kisi shakhs par fisq ki tohmat na lagaye aur na us par kufr ki tohmat lagaye warna woh usi par laut aayegi agar us ka sathi aisa na hua to."
"433","Aur sanad ke saath Hazrat Abu Dharr se rivayat hai, unhon ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko farmate hue suna: Jo shakhs apne baap ke siwa ghair ki taraf nisbat ka daawa kare aur woh janta ho to yaqeenan us ne kufr kiya, aur jo shakhs aisi qaum ka daawa kare jis me se woh nahi hai to use chahiye ke woh apna thikana jahannam me bana le, aur jis ne kisi aadmi ko kufr ke saath pukara ya kaha: Allah ka dushman, aur woh aisa na ho to woh baat usi par laut aayegi."
"434","Umar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mere walid ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Aamash ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Adi bin Sabit ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: main ne Sulaiman bin Surad ko suna, jo Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke sahaba me se ek mard the, unhon ne farmaya: Do aadmi Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke paas aapas me gaali galoch karne lage to un me se ek ko gussa aaya, pas us ka gussa shadeed ho gaya hatta ke us ka chehra phool gaya aur badal gaya, to Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Beshak main ek kalima janta hun, agar woh use kahe to us se woh kaifiyat door ho jaye jo woh pa raha hai, pas ek mard us ki taraf gaya, to us ne use Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke qaul ki khabar di aur kaha: Shaitan mardood se Allah ki panah maang, to us ne kaha: Kya tu mujh me koi takleef dekhta hai, kya main majnoon hun, ja."
"435","Khallad bin Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, woh Yazeed bin Abi Ziyad se, woh Amr bin Salama se, woh Abdullah se, unhon ne farmaya: Koi do musalman nahi magar un ke darmiyan Allah azza wa jal ki taraf se parda hai, pas jab un me se ek apne saathi se talluq todne wali baat kahe to us ne Allah ke parde ko phaad diya, aur jab un me se ek doosre se kahe: Tu kafir hai, to un me se ek kufr me par gaya hai."
"436","Umar bin Hafs ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mere walid ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Aamash ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muslim ne hum se bayan kiya, woh Masrooq se, unhon ne kaha: Aisha ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne ek kaam kiya, to us me rukhsat di, to ek qaum us se bachi, pas ye baat Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko pahunchi to unhon ne khutba diya, pas Allah ki hamd ki, phir farmaya: Un logon ka kya haal hai jo us cheez se bachte hain jo main karta hun, pas Allah ki qasam beshak main un me sab se zyada Allah ko janne wala hun aur un me us se sab se zyada darne wala hun."
"437","Abdur Rahman bin Mubarak ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Zaid ne hum se bayan kiya, woh Salm Alawi se, woh Hazrat Anas se, unhon ne farmaya: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam kam hi kisi aadmi ka samna us cheez se karte the jise woh napasand karta tha, pas ek din ek aadmi un ke paas dakhil hua aur us par zardi ka nishan tha, pas jab woh khada hua to unhon ne apne sahaba se kaha: Kash woh is zardi ko badal de ya door kar de."
"438","Musa ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdul Aziz ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Husain ne hum se bayan kiya, woh Saad bin Ubaidah se, woh Abu Abdur Rahman Sulami se, unhon ne kaha: main ne Hazrat Ali raziyallahu anhu ko farmate hue suna: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne mujhe aur Zubair bin Awwam ko bheja aur hum dono me se har ek sawaar tha, pas unhon ne farmaya: Chalo hatta ke tum falan falan rauza tak pahunch jao aur wahan ek aurat hai jis ke paas Hatib ki taraf se mushrikeen ki taraf ek khat hai, pas use mere paas le aao, pas hum ne use pa liya ke woh apne oont par chal rahi thi jahan Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne humare liye bayan farmaya tha, to hum ne kaha: Woh khat jo tere paas hai, us ne kaha: Mere paas koi khat nahi hai, to hum ne us ki aur us ke oont ki talashi li, to mere saathi ne kaha: Main kuch nahi dekhta, to main ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne jhoot nahi kaha aur qasam us zaat ki jis ke haath me meri jaan hai ya to main tujhe nanga kar dunga ya tu use zaroor nikaalegi, pas us ne apne haath se apne kamarband ki taraf ishara kiya aur us par oon ka izar tha, to us ne use nikaal diya, pas hum Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke paas aaye, to Umar ne kaha: Us ne Allah aur us ke Rasool aur momineen se khiyanat ki, mujhe chhor dijiye ke main us ki gardan maar dun, aur unhon ne kaha: Tujhe is par kis cheez ne ubhara, to us ne kaha: Mujh me is ke siwa koi baat nahi ke main Allah par iman rakhne wala hun aur main ne chaha ke qaum ke paas mera koi ehsan ho, unhon ne kaha: Ae Umar us ne sach kaha, kya woh Badr me hazir nahi hua, shayad Allah un ki taraf muttala hua to farmaya: Jo chaho karo pas yaqeenan tumhare liye jannat wajib ho gayi hai, to Umar ki dono aankhen aansuon se bhar gayin aur unhon ne kaha: Allah aur us ka Rasool zyada janne wale hain."
"439","Ismail ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Malik ne hum se bayan kiya, woh Abdullah bin Dinar se, woh Abdullah bin Umar se, ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Jo bhi mard apne bhai se kahe: Kafir, to un dono me se ek us ke saath lautega."
"440","Saeed bin Dawood ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Malik ne hum se bayan kiya, ke Nafi ne un ko bayan kiya, ke Abdullah bin Umar ne un ko khabar di, ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Jab woh doosre se kahe: Kafir, to un dono me se ek kufr me par gaya, agar woh jis se us ne kaha woh kafir hai to us ne sach kaha aur agar waisa na ho jaisa us ne us se kaha to jis ne ye baat kahi woh kufr ke saath lautega."
"441","Abdullah bin Muhammad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, woh Sumayy se, woh Abu Salih se, woh Abu Huraira se, ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam bure faisle se aur dushmanon ke khush hone se panah maanga karte the."
"442","Abdullah bin Yusuf ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Malik ne hum ko khabar di, woh Suhail bin Abi Salih se, woh apne walid se, woh Abu Huraira se, ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Beshak Allah tumhare liye teen baaton se raazi hota hai aur tumhare liye teen baaton se naraz hota hai, tumhare liye is baat se raazi hota hai: Ke tum us ki ibadat karo aur us ke saath kisi cheez ko shareek na karo, aur ke tum sab mil kar Allah ki rassi ko mazbooti se thaame raho, aur ke tum us shakhs ki khair khwahi karo jise Allah ne tumhare muamle ka wali banaya, aur tumhare liye napasand karta hai: Qeel wa qaal, aur kasrat se sawal karna, aur maal ko zaya karna."
"443","Abdullah bin Saeed ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Saeed bin Mansur ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ismail bin Zakariyya ne hum se bayan kiya, woh Amr bin Qais Mulai se, woh Minhal se, woh Saeed bin Jubair se, woh Ibn Abbas se, Allah azza wa jal ke qaul: Aur tum jo kuch bhi kharch karo to woh us ka badal deta hai aur woh sab se behtar rizq dene wala hai, ke bare me unhon ne farmaya: Israaf ke baghair aur na tangi ke saath."
